sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Sender Agent
    participant S as Server
    participant B as Recipient Agent
    A->>S: FILE_OFFER with recipient
    S->>B: FILE_OFFER
    B-->>S: FILE_ACCEPT
    S-->>A: FILE_ACCEPT
    loop Bounded chunks with pacing and retry
        A->>S: FILE_CHUNK
        S->>B: FILE_CHUNK
        B->>B: Write unique bytes to temporary file
    end
    A->>S: FILE_FINISH
    S->>B: FILE_FINISH
    B->>B: Verify size and SHA-256; finalize file
    B-->>S: FILE_COMPLETE
    S-->>A: FILE_COMPLETE
    A->>A: Mark COMPLETED
    Note over A,B: Errors, rejection and cancellation follow state-machines.md
